# TEST FIXTURE (id 223): the C9 systems (contract section 50): the lobby of a two-room mini league (maps/test_c9sys_b.map = 224) with the PC terminal (the Hall of Legacy entry of its menu) and the way
# in. Not part of the game: reached only by the host harness (tools/host_world, `make c9sys`). Entering the lobby remembers it as the respawn point (`respawn door`, what a Centro's nurse does), so a blackout in
# the rooms comes back here.
@map test_c9sys
@size 14 10
@interior no
@bg 0
@fill dirt_a
@spawn start 6 7 NE
@spawn door 6 7 NE
@legend
  .  tile=dirt_a
  W  tile=dirt_a solid=yes
  P  tile=dirt_a object=pc interact=look script=pc_box
  N  tile=dirt_a npc=vecino text=c9sys.person face=S
  e  tile=dirt_a
@warp e -> test_c9sys_b spawn=enter1 oneway
@grid
  WWWWWWeWWWWWWW
  W............W
  W............W
  W............W
  W...........PW
  W............W
  W.....N......W
  W............W
  W............W
  WWWWWWWWWWWWWW
# the Centro's rule: this lobby is where a blackout sends the hero back to
@script lobby on_enter
    respawn door
@end
# The PC terminal: the box screen of the PC plugin, then the Hall of Legacy browser when its menu asked for it (mapc's `pc` does both, contract 50.4).
@script pc_box interact
    pc
@end
